# Master Pipeline Configuration Template

Copy this file to `.env` in `2_orchestration/` and fill in your values.

## SQL Server Connection

```env
# SQL Server hostname or IP address
SQL_SERVER=DESKTOP-B0PDEI7

# SQL Server port (default: 1433, non-standard: 1434)
SQL_PORT=1434

# Database name
SQL_DB=ATB_BI

# SQL Server login user
SQL_USER=airbyte_user

# SQL Server password (keep secure!)
SQL_PASSWORD=AZERTY123

# ODBC Driver version
ODBC_DRIVER=ODBC Driver 17 for SQL Server

# Connection timeout (seconds)
SQL_TIMEOUT=300

# Number of retries on connection failure
SQL_RETRIES=2
```

## Airbyte Configuration

```env
# Airbyte API endpoint
AIRBYTE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Airbyte API authentication key
AIRBYTE_API_KEY=default_key

# Airbyte connection timeout (seconds)
AIRBYTE_TIMEOUT=1800

# Airbyte sync poll interval (seconds)
AIRBYTE_POLL_INTERVAL=10
```

