## Verification

After setting configuration, verify:

```bash
# Check SQL Server connection
docker exec airflow-scheduler python -c "
import pyodbc
conn_str = f'Driver={{ODBC Driver 17 for SQL Server}};Server={{os.getenv(\"SQL_SERVER\")}},{os.getenv(\"SQL_PORT\")};Database={{os.getenv(\"SQL_DB\")}};UID={{os.getenv(\"SQL_USER\")}};PWD={{os.getenv(\"SQL_PASSWORD\")}}'
conn = pyodbc.connect(conn_str)
print('✓ SQL Server OK')
"

# Check dbt
docker exec airflow-scheduler dbt debug

# Check Airbyte
curl $AIRBYTE_API_URL/api/v1/health
```

